<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Pao de Acucar 1996 net 120.6 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Pao de Acucar 1996 net 120.6 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil supermarket chain Grupo Pao de Acucar, formerly known as Companhia Brasileira de Distribuicao, said its 1996 results were as follows in Brazilian reais</p>
<p>			   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Dividends	 0.433668 real	    N/A</p>
<p>    Net profit	120.6 million	    N/A</p>
<p>    Net sales	 2.9 bln		    N/A</p>
<p>Dividend figures are per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 net profit rose 57.6 percent over 1995. It said it would publish its balance sheet on Feb 18.</p>
<p>Adjusting for inflation, the company posted a net profit of 114.4 million reais and net sales of 3.0 billion reais.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
